Hriate:
{{Short description|Slovak alcoholic drink}}
{{Orphan|date=January 2025}}

[[File:Hriate.jpg|thumb|Hriate at the [[Christmas Market, Bratislava]] (2022)]]
'''Hriate''' ({{IPA|sk|'ɦrɪɐte}}) or '''hriata''' ({{IPA|sk|'ɦrɪɐta}}, literally "Heated", dialectally ''hriatô'', ''hriato'') is a Slovak [[alcoholic drink]]<ref>STOLIČNÁ, Rastislava. Strava ako etnoidentifikačný znak. ''Český lid'', 2001, 15–27.</ref><ref>Škvarna, D., 2002: [http://zborniky.e-slovak.sk/SAS_31_2002.pdf Genéza moderných slovenských národných symbolov.]</ref> with different variants of preparation. It can also be drunk as an [[aperitif]].<ref name=":1">{{Cite web|title=Vianočné sviatky kedysi a dnes: Poznáte všetky tieto zvyky a tradície?|url=https://www.forbes.sk/vianocne-sviatky-kedysi-a-dnes-poznate-vsetky-tieto-zvyky-a-tradicie/|website=Forbes|date=2021-12-23|accessdate=2022-02-09|language=sk-SK}}</ref>

It is prepared in several forms, especially in the [[Central Slovakia|Central]] and [[Eastern Slovakia]], especially in the [[Liptov]], [[Orava (region)|Orava]] and [[Spiš]]. The hriate base is [[honey]]<ref>{{Cite book | title = Komenského slovník naučný | publisher = Nakl. a vydavatelství Komenského slovníku naučného | year = 1938 | page = 288|language=cs}}</ref> with fried [[bacon]] or [[butter]], but there are also variants with [[sugar]] ([[caramel]]) instead of honey, and [[liquor]]. Traditionally it is served at Christmas or during the winter season in mountain and foothill areas.<ref name=":1" /> Many households have their own specific recipes. The drink was considered a healing agent.<ref>{{Cite book | chapter = pálenka | title = Encyklopédia ľudovej kultúry Slovenska 2 | edition = 1 | publisher = Veda | location = Bratislava | year = 1995 | isbn = 80-224-0235-4 | page = 9 | language = sk}}</ref>

In Liptov, hriate was served before dinner on [[Christmas Eve]] and [[New Year's Eve]] and was traditionally made from [[vodka]] warmed over caramel and eaten with [[Pork rind#Europe|''oškvarky'']].<ref>KANDEROVÁ, Diana. ''Vývoj gastronomických služieb a jeho vplyv na ekonomiku vybraného regiónu''. 2017. PhD Thesis. Praha: Vysoká škola hotelová a ekonomická</ref>

